---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/main.astro";
import Header from "@/components/header.astro";
import { ResolutionDelayTest } from "@/components/tests/resolution-delay-test.tsx";
---

<PageLayout title="HE RD Test | Happy Eyeballs Webtester">
  <Header titleLine1="Happy Eyeballs" titleLine2="Resolution Delay Test">
    <p>
      We set up a DNS nameserver that introduces a delay based on parameters
      specified in the requested domain name. Our test sends a configured number
      of delay configurations for each DNS record type, allowing us to test how
      browsers deploy the Happy Eyeballs Resolution Delay.
    </p>
    <p>
      We randomize domain names to prevent caching effects on both the browser
      and resolver. Additionally, the web server only offers HTTP/1.1 to prevent
      connection reuse between tests.
    </p>
    <p>
      Please note that the connection attempt trace for this test is currently
      unreliable, as correlation requires an SNI to be present.
    </p>
  </Header>

  <ResolutionDelayTest client:load />
</PageLayout>
